  Keys  Esc close · ↑/↓/PgUp/PgDn scroll                                        
  ↑/↓/k/j              move the cursor                                          
  Enter/Space          open or switch to a connection, or toggle a group        
  ←/→/h/l              on a group: collapse / expand it                         
  Shift+↑/↓/K/J        on a group: move it up / down (or drag its header)       
  /  ^B /              filter the connection list                               
  Esc                  clear the filter                                         
  [/]  ^B [/]          previous / next tab                                      
  {/}  ^B {/}          previous / next open connection in the Space             
  P/S/1-9  ^B P/S/1-9  Space picker / Space names / switch to Space 1-9         
  H  ^B H              History picker: open a recent connection from any Space  
  ^B n                 new tab for the active connection                        
  ^B i/p               bootstrap / provision in its own tab                     
  ^B g                 open the connection's group as tabs                      
  ^B m                 move a connection to a group (or drag it)                
  t  ^B t              start / stop the connection's tunnels                    
  a/e/d/C  ^B a/e/d/C  add / edit / delete connection or group / group color    
  ^B w  r/x            close tab (ended tab, tunnel row: r reconnect, x close)  
  ^B Tab               move focus between list and terminal                     
  ^B s                 scroll back (mouse wheel also scrolls)                   
  ^B b/R               hide or show the list / refresh from ssh_config          
  ^B ^B/?              send the prefix key to the session / show this help      
  q/^C  ^B q/^C        quit                                                     
